{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0143_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a90721cc28f930db44e07c808c2374a9d4e15b2b616af3394bec2d385a7127a8", "ja": "（地方公演が無事終わり、劇場に帰ってきた。\nそして今日は『タウラス』の、劇場お披露目だが……）", "zh": "（地区公演顺利结束，回到了剧场。\n而今天是『金牛座』在剧场的首次亮相，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0143_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "e10db8052a201fb6011bce20f155e48d9eef7295f6f00a6217397b7b755c9f8f", "ja": "むむ……何を使ったらいいんでしょう～？\n将棋盤は、ちょっと痛そうですね～。", "zh": "唔……到底该用什么好呢～？\n用将棋盘的话，好像会有点痛呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0143_1002_p", "source_sha256": "222a6cb8d0482f789a6e9ceb831a6919ddf3e8cba6b54db881f2275ad2f9eac5", "ja": "美也、さっきから何を悩んでるんだ？\n将棋盤とか聞こえたけど……。", "zh": "美也，你从刚才起就在烦恼什么呢？\n好像听到你说棋盘什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0143_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "afdf24cbd5a97e1920969f55803735ce2d887e85822f771f07f09d3d9f392a99", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん～。\nちょうどいいところに～。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生～。\n你来得正好～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0143_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "15c7fd14549d97bdc12a85b4a9bea7d0fea545dd1dd9ce4966444c93058299c0", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、\n何とぶつかったら、記憶喪失になれると思いますか～？", "zh": "您觉得，{$P$}先生要和什么相撞，才会失忆呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0143_1005_p", "source_sha256": "339499d5196cf7cd4a7464a237af15297debf07f0f584b9bd3a3dc0dce1c3a0f", "ja": "記憶喪失？\n……って、もしかして美也……。", "zh": "记忆丧失？\n……等等，难道是美也……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0143_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "93191275617a599c5fb97b38affc4a1b58b28da06a37c24f655b89b74592c2eb", "ja": "はい～。未来ちゃんと話していて、「私たちも\n記憶喪失になってみよう」ということになりまして～。", "zh": "是的～。我和未来聊天时，觉得“我们也来试试看失忆吧”，于是就这么决定了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0143_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "57969ed10d3122736d6d54d3873e3829569c863fbc4f940e5a810728952fa7b8", "ja": "けど隕石は、もう地球を通り過ぎてしまいましたし～。\n何にぶつかればいいのかわからなくて……。", "zh": "不过陨石已经飞过地球了～，我都不知道该撞上什么才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0143_1008_p", "source_sha256": "bb5d9f24611ad341588f764abc874e8d28dc04d6d0536b9c06763d903e3d6813", "ja": "それは俺にもわからないけど……。\nけど、どうして記憶喪失になりたいんだ？", "zh": "这个我也不知道……  \n不过，你为什么想要失忆呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0143_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "f797ba71a08e7cae5fcaea8b250527ac9a8c2252e640cbf0699b9844f0ed0895", "ja": "もちろん、今日の公演のためですよ～。\nタウラスは、私たち3人のユニットですからね～。", "zh": "当然是为了今天的演出呀～。\n毕竟金牛座是我们3个人的组合嘛～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0143_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "5165fd717af17ea2f21d9435d21a9c84a804081b6b25359e2c7e4038dc0a356b", "ja": "まつりちゃんの体験したことを、\n私たちも体験したかったんですけど～。", "zh": "我们也想体验一下小茉莉经历过的事情～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0143_1011_p", "source_sha256": "28f69139eae430ff5fb32fb72a64259d8fe8012f55544edbb5d8b1754ca6a2b1", "ja": "そうか……体験したい気持ちはわからなくないけど、\n記憶喪失なんてそうそうあるものじゃないし……。", "zh": "这样啊……虽然我也不是不能理解你们想亲身体验的心情，但失忆这种事可不是随随便便就会遇上的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0143_1012_p", "source_sha256": "046149a543ca53364c0a3cd14912dd5f5168794789191604a611aaac12f740e4", "ja": "それに、何かにぶつかるなんて危ないし……\n万が一戻らなかったら、それこそ困るからな。", "zh": "而且，撞上什么东西也太危险了……\n万一恢复不了记忆，那可就麻烦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0143_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "702fbcc9393e06c6aa4adacc5bda919918a4f0b23c0ee58691c3a850bdbebc9d", "ja": "む～ん、そうですよね～。\n残念ですけど、今回はあきらめましょう～。", "zh": "唔～确实是这样呢～。\n虽然很遗憾，但这次就放弃吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0143_1014_p", "source_sha256": "627866c5f43b383f7a921822d530c09efbaedbcc5560afe66ad81203f3c17ef9", "ja": "ああ、そうしてくれ。……けど美也は、\n記憶喪失になるのが怖くないのか？", "zh": "啊，那就这么办吧。……不过美也，\n你不害怕失去记忆吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0143_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "90f6eaa15f31efcaf59d698c1ac5d8b8d80f6fade448fc619b0eed5fe6d24324", "ja": "そうですね～。思い出せないのは、怖いですけど……\nでも、たくさんの初めましてに出会えますから～。", "zh": "是啊～。虽然想不起过去会让人害怕……不过，也能遇见许多初次见面的人呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0143_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "fe84ffb5ada3ee2542aa891d406c3585833cd9f3ad8d624bd1cdd48f97870261", "ja": "それに、もし私が思い出せなかったとしても。\nみんなとなら、アイドルができる気がするんですよ～。", "zh": "而且，就算我没能想起来，只要和大家在一起，我觉得自己也能继续当偶像呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0143_1017_p", "source_sha256": "68aa6a6436ed13362862833aa75fbe0b48a1be25cb42b6f5f053852716c8be28", "ja": "そうか。美也がアイドルでいてくれるのは嬉しいけど、\n劇場やみんなの事を忘れてしまうのは寂しいな……。", "zh": "这样啊。美也愿意继续当偶像，我当然很高兴，可要是忘了剧场和大家的事，还是会觉得寂寞啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0143_1018_042miy", "source_sha256": "d6188c9d6a32ef3233fff306a3e80698452536aea707bc5b46f2233b20d87714", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ、{$P$}さん～。\n私は劇場や、みんなのことが、大好きですから～。", "zh": "没事的，{$P$}先生～\n因为我很喜欢剧场，也很喜欢大家呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0143_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "2c60bbd7911094caa693a1e469790ca20502e335ef33a57f740671d79cce3ee1", "ja": "大好きな気持ちは、ちゃんと覚えている\n自信がありますよ～。むふふ。", "zh": "这份喜欢的感情，我有自信会好好记在心里的～。呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0143_1020_p", "source_sha256": "5f37723473cfa17561c533c1bc4c049cfe10fa67aa7ab32119bc5ddad1ad5a09", "ja": "その自信はどこから……。\nでも、美也だったら本当に覚えていそうだな。", "zh": "这份自信到底是从哪儿来的……  \n不过，要是美也的话，感觉她真的能记住呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0143_1021_042miy", "source_sha256": "cbef798bf5dedd388e8d3da64068033bdd462e46b63ab502b04cfb2a1004291e", "ja": "はい～。まかせてください～。\n絶対に、忘れませんからね～。", "zh": "好的～交给我吧～  \n我绝对不会忘记的哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
